WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.207
An inference goes beyond what a passage says directly but must still be supported by

00:00:05.207 --> 00:00:05.875
its details.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:11.840
“Abena returned a lost purse to its owner.” Which value does the action show? Answer:

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.183
Honesty

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:17.842
Read a short passage and answer literal, vocabulary and inference questions with

00:00:17.842 --> 00:00:18.644
supporting clues.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.245
Why it works: Returning property shows honesty.
